  "description": "PIWNOC crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C68 H123 Co1 La6 O40. From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 9 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 6 O neighbors; La1B (La) has 9 O neighbors; La2B (La) has 9 O neighbors; La3B (La) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.524-4.250 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.53-116.16°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [La6Co(μ3-OH)8(acac)12(CH3O)4(CH3OH)4]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
